<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Bank of Ireland says B&amp;W transfer complete.</title>
<headline>Bank of Ireland says B&amp;W transfer complete.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Ireland said on Monday that the transfer of the business of Bristol and West Building Society to a unit of the Bank has been completed.</p>
<p>B &amp; W said the move provided B &amp; W with the financial strength to pursue new growth opportunities and to compete aggressively in a rapidly changing market.  </p>
<p>Bank of Ireland bought the building society in a deal which valued Bristol &amp; West at 600 million sterling.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom + 353 1 676 9775</p>
</text>
